      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "The flow — four steps, and no content-type decision",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-09-30 (placement ruling 3): *\"only basic doc ingestion high level\nworkflow in cat-harness. very little process context assumed. just that the\nuploaded asset has extracted metadata inserted into KG and asset in library/\n(if materialized).\"*",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-30"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "proposal",
      "cat-harness:section": "The flow — four steps, and no content-type decision",
      "prov:value": "**Materialized?** — the state vocabulary is `schemas/kg/materialization-state.ts`\n   (placement PR5): `referenced`, `materialized` or `unknown`, with no default.\n4."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "TWO entry points, and this said \"one\" until 2026-09-20",
      "prov:value": "## TWO entry points, and this said \"one\" until 2026-09-20",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-4",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Who owns which half, and why it is not arbitrary",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-09-20: *\"some in cat-harness, some in folio-asst-core (and further\ndown dep tree)\"*.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-5",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "proposal",
      "cat-harness:section": "Who owns which half, and why it is not arbitrary",
      "prov:value": "Reading bytes is platform\n  work, and the owner's standing instruction is that **OCR stays here**. The\n  method that chooses among them is a refinement above (placement PR6)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "proposal",
      "cat-harness:section": "Who owns which half, and why it is not arbitrary",
      "prov:value": "- **The remote half's gates belong to the content layer above.** PR5 moved\n  only the state vocabulary down; the five gates, the purposes and the record\n  binding them stay with the layer that owns content, because each gate is a\n  decision about content."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Who owns which half, and why it is not arbitrary",
      "prov:value": "- **The `large-datasets` package owns the question before both**\n  ([`skills/library/large-datasets/`](../large-datasets/materialize-remote.md),\n  an instance of its own until bean `j7ql` dissolved it here): how to\n  enumerate a corpus and ask it for a subset (`source-descriptor.ts`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean j7ql"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "A held PDF gets its page-1 cover BEFORE the upload is retired",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-10-16 and again 2026-10-30: an entry with no cover showed its\nfirst figure as its picture, and for `arxiv-2404.04834v4` that was a\nnear-black game screenshot from page 11, on the library row and the folio\nglass.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-16",
        "2026-10-30"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-16",
        "2026-10-30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-9",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "A held PDF gets its page-1 cover BEFORE the upload is retired",
      "prov:value": "Once the PDF moves to\n  `fsh-guts/uploads/`, `library:covers` no longer finds it and skips the entry\n  as \"not held\". Of cat-harness's 60 entries, 42 were retired with no cover\n  and still show the glyph (2026-10-30).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-30"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-10",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "After ingestion the upload is RETIRED — never left, never deleted",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-09-29: *\"no, uploads is archival copy\"*, then *\"archival (once\ningested into KG and put into a proper `library/` under a harness repo) then\nit should be moved to `fsh-guts`.\"*",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-29"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-29"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-11",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "After ingestion the upload is RETIRED — never left, never deleted",
      "prov:value": "The full rule — why the library cannot be the destination, the sidecar\nconvention, the four-faced 2026-09-30 sweep, the blocking and advisory\nfamilies, the state after correction, and renaming — is in\n[`library-ingestion/uploads-retirement.md`](library-ingestion/uploads-retirement.md).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-09-30"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/library/library-core/library-ingestion.md#provenance-12",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "A second representation sits DOWNSTREAM of the entry",
      "prov:value": "A content type may describe an ingested document a second time, in its own\nschema — a WHO guideline is also an L1 knowledge graph. Owner, 2026-10-07:\n*\"Library is upstream to L1.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-07"
      ],
